--- Note on what this licence does and does not cover ---

This licence covers the CODE in this repository. It does not cover:

* the models this pipeline calls. FLUX.1-dev and the texture generator carry
  their own licences, and FLUX.1-dev's makes its OUTPUTS non-commercial. A
  texture produced by this pipeline inherits the terms of the models that made
  it — see docs/specifications/model-terms.md;
* the 3D assets you run it on, which keep their own licences.
